(*
Owns the state used by one workflow contract test scenario.

Each fixture starts with freshly constructed function blocks and stores no borrowed assertion context.
Owns synthetic in-memory workflows and tasks. A dynamically loaded workflow is tracked until checked release.
The case releases it before fixture destruction, including when a scenario reports an exception.
*)

{attribute 'enable_dynamic_creation'}
{attribute 'no_assign'}
{attribute 'no_explicit_call' := 'do not call this function block directly'}
